Description: Astrology (GTK 4)
 Desktop astrology application for natal charts, transits, and synastry.
 .
 Features include natal, transit, synastry/composite charts, customizable
 planets and aspects, online/offline atlas (Geonames), chart export, and
 Swiss Ephemeris calculations via bundled pysweph (PyPI).
